      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "For example, the following code evaluates the polynomial with the coefficients `[10.0, 20.0, 30.0]` and the variables `[7.0, 5.0]`:",
      "normalizedSource": "For example, the following code evaluates the polynomial with the coefficients `[10.0, 20.0, 30.0]` and the variables `[7.0, 5.0]`:",
