      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\n    let coefficients: [Float] = [10, 20, 30]\n    let variables: [Float] = [7, 5]\n    \n    let result = [Float](\n        unsafeUninitializedCapacity: variables.count) {\n            buffer, initializedCount in\n            \n            vDSP.evaluatePolynomial(usingCoefficients: coefficients,\n                                                 withVariables: variables,\n                                    result: &buffer)\n            \n            initializedCount = 2\n        }\n   \n    // Prints \"[660.0, 380.0]\".\n    //    result[0] = (10 * 7²) + (20 * 7¹) + (30 * 7⁰) = 660\n    //    result[1] = (10 * 5²) + (20 * 5¹) + (30 * 5⁰) = 380\n    print(result)\n```",
      "documentTitle": "evaluatePolynomial(usingCoefficients:withVariables:result:)",
      "framework": "Accelerate",
