      "normalizedSource": "```swift let coefficients: [Float] = [10, 20, 30] let variables: [Float] = [7, 5] let result = [Float]( unsafeUninitializedCapacity: variables.count) { buffer, initializedCount in vDSP.evaluatePolynomial(usingCoefficients: coefficients, withVariables: variables, result: &buffer) initializedCount = 2 } // Prints \"[660.0, 380.0]\". // result[0] = (10 * 7²) + (20 * 7¹) + (30 * 7⁰) = 660 // result[1] = (10 * 5²) + (20 * 5¹) + (30 * 5⁰) = 380 print(result) ```",
